sequenceDiagram
actor Staff as "Admin/Operator/Sales"
participant UI as "Interface: UI"
participant API as "mainController: Controller"
participant Payment as "paymentService: Service"
participant PayOS as "PayOS: External System"
participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
alt PayOS prepaid
    Staff->>UI: Request checkout after final approval
    UI->>+API: POST /api/v1/payments/orders/{orderId}/payos-checkout
    API->>Payment: createCheckoutFromApprovedAmount()
    Payment->>PayOS: Create checkout
    PayOS-->>UI: Checkout/redirect
    PayOS->>API: Verified webhook
    API->>Payment: validateSignatureAmountAndOrder()
else Manual/COD/deferred collection
    Staff->>UI: Record full payment evidence
    UI->>+API: POST /api/v1/payments/orders/{orderId}/collect
    API->>Payment: collectFullAmount()
end
Payment->>DB: Idempotently update canonical ledger
DB-->>API: Confirmed payment or conflict
API-->>-UI: Payment result

